    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40012" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίλεκτ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>chosen</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐ. γένος Ἰσραήλ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.242
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλα πρὸς εὐωδίαν</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				5.6
