					Callix.
					2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. esp. of
			soldiers, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἐπίλεκτοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					3.4.43
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>HG</u>
				5.3.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.680.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IPE</u>
				12.352.39
			</span></i> (Cherson.); in Egypt, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				731
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				110.21
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>. 
