			 (q.v.), <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				10.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b>.
			= Lat. <i>extraordinarii</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.26.6
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
				Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>, 
